{"seq":2,"slug":"self-speculative","title":"自推测与早退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/self-speculative","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自推测与早退\">自推测与早退</h1><p>独立草稿模型有一个绕不开的麻烦：你得额外养一个模型——多占显存、要管对齐、要单独训练或挑选。自推测（self-speculation）从一个朴素的反问出发：既然目标模型自己就是最懂目标分布的，为什么不让它<strong>自己充当草稿</strong>？只要让它「快但糙」地跑一遍当草稿，再「慢但准」地跑一遍当验证，就能省掉整个第二模型。本篇讲三种把目标模型变成自己草稿的办法：层早退、层跳过、以及把多 token 预测头直接焊进模型（DeepSeek MTP）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-同一组权重-两种-快-慢-用法\">核心概念：同一组权重，两种「快/慢」用法</h2><p>自推测的共同思想是：从目标模型里切出一个「廉价子计算」当草稿，用完整计算当验证。由于草稿和验证共享同一套权重，词表对齐、分布同源这些独立草稿模型的老大难问题自动消失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[目标模型 完整 N 层] --&gt; B[&quot;草稿: 廉价子计算&lt;br/&gt;早退 / 跳层 / MTP 头&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;验证: 完整 N 层前向&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;快但糙的 token 候选&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;逐位接受 -&gt; 无损输出&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;全程一套权重&lt;br/&gt;天然词表对齐&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[目标模型 完整 N 层] --&gt; B[\"草稿: 廉价子计算&lt;br/&gt;早退 / 跳层 / MTP 头\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"验证: 完整 N 层前向\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"快但糙的 token 候选\"]\n  D --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; E[\"逐位接受 -&gt; 无损输出\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"全程一套权重&lt;br/&gt;天然词表对齐\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>自推测方式</th>\n<th>草稿怎么来</th>\n<th>是否需训练</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>层早退（early-exit）</td>\n<td>只跑前若干层就出 token</td>\n<td>通常需训练早退头</td>\n<td>LayerSkip 类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层跳过（layer-skip）</td>\n<td>推理时随机/按规则跳过部分层</td>\n<td>微调使其鲁棒</td>\n<td>Self-Speculative Decoding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 token 预测头（MTP）</td>\n<td>主模型内置的额外预测头</td>\n<td>预训练时一起训</td>\n<td>DeepSeek V3/V4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"层早退与层跳过-从中间-偷-一个草稿\">层早退与层跳过：从中间「偷」一个草稿</h2><p>Transformer 的深层往往在做「精修」，浅层就已经能给出大致靠谱的 token。层早退正是利用这一点：草稿阶段只前向跑前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27; &lt; N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 层，接上一个轻量输出头直接出 token；验证阶段再跑完整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 层。草稿成本只有完整前向的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{L&#x27;}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3185em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9735em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8278em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>层跳过是它的变体：不固定截断在前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 层，而是在推理时按某种策略跳过中间的若干层。为了让被跳层后的模型仍能给出可用 token，通常要对模型做一轮「带随机跳层」的微调，使它对缺层鲁棒。</p>\n<p>这两种方法的代价是接受率：浅层草稿与完整模型的分布偏差比独立小模型还可能更大，接受率往往不如训练良好的独立草稿或下面的 MTP。但它<strong>零额外显存、零额外模型</strong>，在显存受限或不想维护第二模型时很有吸引力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deepseek-mtp-把草稿头焊进预训练\">DeepSeek MTP：把草稿头焊进预训练</h2><p>2026 年最主流的自推测形态，是把「多 token 预测」（Multi-Token Prediction, MTP）直接写进模型架构、和主模型一起从头预训练。DeepSeek-V3 率先大规模采用，并延续到 V4；据公开资料，到 2026 年 DeepSeek V3.x、V4、GLM-5.1 以及部分 Llama 4 变体的发布权重里都带有 MTP 头。</p>\n<p>它和「事后训练一个草稿」的根本区别在于<strong>联合训练</strong>：主模型的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置除了预测第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token（主目标），还通过额外的 MTP 头同时被要求预测第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>main</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mtext>MTP-</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{main}} + \\lambda \\sum_{k=2}^{K} \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MTP-}k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MTP-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mtext>MTP-</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MTP-}k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MTP-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预测「往后第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token」的交叉熵。这样训练带来两重好处：训练时 MTP 是个有益的辅助目标、能提升主模型本身的表征质量；推理时这些头天然就是高质量草稿——它们和主模型完全同源、且专门为「预测更远的 token」而训。2026 年 6 月 27 日 DeepSeek 发布的 DSpark 进一步为 V4 提供了专门的半自回归草稿器，把 MTP 路线又推进一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;主模型前向到位置 t&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;主头: 预测 t+1 token&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;MTP 头 2: 预测 t+2 token&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;MTP 头 3: 预测 t+3 token&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;推理时: 主头 + MTP 头一起&lt;br/&gt;给出 t+1 t+2 t+3 草稿&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;主模型完整前向验证&lt;br/&gt;无损接受&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"主模型前向到位置 t\"] --&gt; B[\"主头: 预测 t+1 token\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"MTP 头 2: 预测 t+2 token\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"MTP 头 3: 预测 t+3 token\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"推理时: 主头 + MTP 头一起&lt;br/&gt;给出 t+1 t+2 t+3 草稿\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"主模型完整前向验证&lt;br/&gt;无损接受\"]</pre><p>MTP 与下一章的 <a href=\"../advanced/medusa-heads\">Medusa 多头</a> 在「给主模型加多个预测头」这一点上形态相似，但定位不同：MTP 是<strong>预训练</strong>时就联合训练、随权重一起发布；Medusa 是在一个<strong>已训好</strong>的模型上事后微调加挂的轻量头。EAGLE 则更进一步，在特征层而非 token 层做推测（见 <a href=\"../advanced/eagle-feature\">EAGLE 特征级推测</a>）。本篇把 MTP 归入「自推测」，是因为它的草稿来自主模型自身的内置头，而非外挂的独立网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型-什么时候用自推测\">选型：什么时候用自推测</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>自推测是否合适</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>显存极度紧张、容不下第二个模型</td>\n<td>适合（层早退/跳层零额外参数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型权重自带 MTP 头（DeepSeek 等）</td>\n<td>强烈推荐（开箱即用、接受率高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用的是无 MTP 头的开源模型、又能改训练</td>\n<td>可考虑层跳过微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只想零改造、有现成同系列小模型</td>\n<td>用 <a href=\"draft-model-speculation\">独立草稿模型</a> 更省事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出大量复制输入（代码/RAG/改写）</td>\n<td>先试 <a href=\"ngram-retrieval-draft\">n-gram 与检索草稿</a>，几乎零成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自推测让目标模型自己当草稿：从一套权重里切出「廉价子计算」当草稿、完整计算当验证，天然词表对齐、分布同源，省掉第二个模型。</li>\n<li>层早退只跑前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 层、层跳过推理时略过中间层，零额外参数但接受率较低，且层跳过通常需鲁棒性微调。</li>\n<li>DeepSeek MTP 把多 token 预测头联合预训练进主模型，2026 年已成主流；既改善主模型表征，又提供高质量同源草稿，DSpark 进一步强化该路线。</li>\n<li>MTP（预训练联合）与 Medusa（事后微调外挂）形态相似定位不同；自推测适合显存紧张或权重自带 MTP 头的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：另两类草稿源见 <a href=\"draft-model-speculation\">独立草稿模型</a> 与 <a href=\"ngram-retrieval-draft\">n-gram 与检索草稿</a>；事后加头的进阶方案见 <a href=\"../advanced/medusa-heads\">Medusa 多头</a>。跨库可参考 <a href=\"../../mixture-of-experts/systems/inference-serving\">Mixture of Experts · 推理服务</a>，MoE 与 MTP 常在同一批前沿模型里共存。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自推测与早退","id":"自推测与早退"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：同一组权重，两种「快/慢」用法","id":"核心概念-同一组权重-两种-快-慢-用法"},{"level":2,"text":"层早退与层跳过：从中间「偷」一个草稿","id":"层早退与层跳过-从中间-偷-一个草稿"},{"level":2,"text":"DeepSeek MTP：把草稿头焊进预训练","id":"deepseek-mtp-把草稿头焊进预训练"},{"level":2,"text":"选型：什么时候用自推测","id":"选型-什么时候用自推测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"独立草稿模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/draft-model-speculation"},"next":{"title":"n-gram 与检索草稿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/ngram-retrieval-draft"}}